{"id":"bac412ecea4b0262","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-mlnull.md","title":"Martin-Löf 零集","display":"df-mlnull — Martin-Löf 零集","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","aliases":["43-df-mlnull"],"display":"df-mlnull — Martin-Löf 零集","label":"43-df-mlnull","type":"definition","depends_on":["[[43-df-mltest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§9.3.2 Definition 9.3.4及Theorem 9.3.5，印刷178–179，PDF198–199","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-mlnull</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mlnull — Martin-Löf 零集"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-mlnull"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§9.3.2 Definition 9.3.4及Theorem 9.3.5，印刷178–179，PDF198–199"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(N\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLTest}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e738767b1d98289f\" href=\"?note=e738767b1d98289f\" title=\"43-df-mltest\">43-df-mltest</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLNull}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLNull}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\">\\(\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)\\)</span> 上的布尔谓词，以下Assertion给出其定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLNull}(N)\\iff\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land N\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLNull}(N)\\iff\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land N\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是有效零集的外覆盖定义；N本身不必可测、有效或Borel。每个这样的N都包含于可测的测度零集。</p>\n<p>来源：§9.3.2 Definition 9.3.4及Theorem 9.3.5，印刷178–179，PDF198–199。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地补充另行注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mltest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mltest","status":"resolved","id":"e738767b1d98289f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $N\\subseteq2^\\omega$；$\\mathrm{MLTest}$ 见 [[43-df-mltest]]，$U$ 遍历 $\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N\\subseteq2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLTest}","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLNull}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLNull}(N)\\iff\\exists U\\;\\left(\\mathrm{MLTest}(U)\\land N\\subseteq\\bigcap_{n\\in\\mathbb N}U_n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1176,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-179","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-mlnull]] — Martin-Löf 零集"},{"id":"26783ec9aa5bef2a","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal B=\\mathcal B(2^\\omega)$ 与公平硬币 Borel 概率测度 $\\mu$ 见 [[43-df-cylinder]]；$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb N$ 采用 [[43-df-effective-coding]] 的配对函数。$N=(N_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal P(2^\\omega)^{\\mathbb N}$，$U=(U_{e,n})_{e,n\\in\\mathbb N}\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N^2}$，$V\\in\\mathcal B^{\\mathbb N}$。$\\mathrm{UniformEffectiveOpen}$ 与 $\\mathrm{MLNull}$ 分别见 [[43-df-effective-open]]、[[43-df-mlnull]]。假设"}],"outgoing":["e738767b1d98289f"]}